\]

From equations (A1.4) and (A3.2) we obtain

$$
d_w = \sqrt[3]{\frac{b}{N_A}} = 3.7 \times 10^{-10} \, \mathrm{m} \approx 4 \times 10^{-10} \, \mathrm{m}
